Subject: [PATCH] Print durable Claw conversation commands for Claw frontend exits
Upstream: OpenAI Codex a592c38c16cdd7623dacc9168926ebccedfb67d3
License: Apache-2.0

COS_TUI_FRONTEND=1 is presentation-only. It does not select a backend or
change authority. A Claw-owned adapter socket dies with its launcher, so
exit guidance must resume the durable conversation through cos instead
of reconnecting to the retired private socket. Other frontends keep the
original commands and stop guidance.

